OL,3,GNEWSANew events planned for struggling
OL,4,Ahistoric hall
OL,5,
OL,6,FMurder mystery parties and World War
OL,7,FTwo-themed events are being planned at
OL,8,Fa struggling historic hall in
OL,9,FLeicestershire to boost visitor
OL,10,Fnumbers.
OL,12,FLeicestershire County Council said
OL,13,FBeaumanor Hall, in Woodhouse, cost
OL,14,F#627,000 to run last year and over the
OL,15,Fyears had been operating at a loss.
OL,17,FThe authority said it would be
OL,18,Ftrialling the activities at the
OL,19,F178-year-old Grade II listed mansion to
OL,20,Fbolster visitor numbers while it draws
OL,21,Fup a longer-term plan to cut running
OL,22,Fcosts and boost income.
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
