OL,3,GNEWSANew events planned for struggling
OL,4,Ahistoric hall
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe plans to introduce more events,
OL,7,Fwhich also include company away days,
OL,8,Ffollow discussions with local residents
OL,9,Fand visitors about the types of
OL,10,Factivities they would like to attend,
OL,11,Fthe council added.
